# Cloudflare Workers static assets — redirects.
# Docs: https://developers.cloudflare.com/workers/static-assets/redirects/
#
# Format: <from> <to> <status>
#
# Trailing slashes are handled automatically by the `html_handling` setting in
# wrangler.jsonc ("auto-trailing-slash"), so they do not need rules here.
#
# apex <-> www is NOT handled here: a Worker only receives requests for
# hostnames routed to it. Set that up once, in the Cloudflare dashboard, as a
# Bulk Redirect or a Redirect Rule on the zone — it is cheaper and it runs
# before the Worker.
#
# Add legacy-URL redirects below as the site evolves, for example:
# /old-services-page  /services/  301
